        "source_sha256": "9500d615399b3a96ba121a4768baa3c9b92b8285ba91d5633bfa0700a7289333",
        "text": "Endorsements\n# Endorsements\n## Josh Becker\nCalifornia State Senate District 13\n## Ray Mueller\nSan Mateo County Board of Supervisors District 3\n## Marc Berman\nCalifornia State Assembly District 23\n- Christine Boles, Mayor\n- Deirdre Martin, Former Mayor\n- Peter Loeb, Former Mayor\n- Karen Ervin, Former Mayor\n- Cindy Abbott, PB&R Commissioner\n- Andy Lie, JUHSD Board Trustee\n- Marcia Settel, State Administrative Law Judge, Retired\n- William Leo Leon, Former Planning Commissioner\n- Sergio Lopez, City of Campbell Councilmember\n- Pranita Venkatesh, Mayor of San Carlos\n- Wei-Tai Kwok, Former Vice Mayor of Lafayette\nHaving served as an elected official, I know that effective leadership isn't about being the loudest voice in the room or refusing to bend. It's about listening, building relationships, finding common ground, and knowing when compromise is necessary to actually get things done.\nThat's why I have such tremendous respect for Margo Meiman.\nMargo is a strong woman who has been doing the work for years—here in our community, throughout the county, and at the state level. She doesn't just talk about leadership; she practices it. She knows how to bring people together, navigate differences, and move things forward.\nDistrict 5 deserves someone who understands that public service is about working with people, not against them. Margo understands that—and she has the experience and track record to prove it.\nI'm proud to stand behind Margo and celebrate the leader she has already shown herself to be.",
        "text_limited": false,
        "title": "Endorsements | Margo Meiman for Pacifica City Council",
